  m_text: "Dating from 1845, De Hoop served as a vital grain mill for the coastal
    village. \r\nIts name, \u201CHope,\u201D reflects the lifeline it gave to Ouddorp."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
